      "id": "aHR0cHM6Ly9rbXNsaC5jb20vaGVscC1jZW50ZXI",
      "title": "Help Center Unified Self-Service & Knowledge Experiences",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://kmslh.com/help-center/",
      "description": "KMS Lighthouse Help Center - Unified Self-Service & Knowledge Experiences | KMS Lighthouse Skip to content Our Solutions I Need Knowledge Management for My Call Center Cut call center holding times by 40% Help Center Unified Self-Service & Knowledge Experiences Onboarding & Training Cut onboarding and training times by up to 70% Field Service Reduce your field teams time-on-site by 60% Integrations Knowledge Center Blog Videos Events News Guides Webinars Reports Glossary ROI Calculator Case Studies About About us Careers Lighthouse University Contact us Book a Demo Knowledge Management » Help Center KMS Lighthouse Help Center Unified Self-Service & Knowledge Experiences The KMS Lighthouse Help Center is built to do one thing above all: minimize your support ticket traffic by giving customers powerful technical self-service, so issues get solved before they ever become tickets, and your support costs drop while satisfaction climbs. Get a tailored demo today Why Choose the KMS Lighthouse Help Center? KMS Lighthouse Help Center turns the knowledge you already maintain into instant, AI-powered self-service. cutting ticket volume and support costs while your customers get answers the moment they need them, with nothing to create or copy twice. Key Advantages One Source, Every Channel Content is authored once and flows automatically from your KMS environment to the call center, service desk, website, mobile app, and chat — so customers get the same accurate answer no matter where they ask. Your Help Center, On Any Page — One embeddable link puts self-service directly into websites, apps, and conversational interfaces — no separate portal for customers to find. Live in Minutes, Not Months Launch a fully branded Help Center with no heavy development or complex integrations — draft, preview, and publish on your timeline. Self-Service, In Any Language Publish content in every language your customers speak, so people can resolve issues independently, raising satisfaction while cutting the friction of waiting for support. Fewer Tickets, Lower Costs Every question answered in the Help Center is a ticket that never reaches your agents — freeing your team to focus on the complex, high-value cases that actually need them. See What's Working, Prove What's Not Real-time analytics on engagement and usage give you clear, shareable proof of the Help Center's impact — so you always know which content is deflecting tickets and which needs attention. Content That Improves Itself Customers rate and comment directly on articles, creating a continuous feedback loop that surfaces gaps and drives ongoing content improvement — straight from the people using it. A Roadmap Built With You, Not Just For You Backed by a dedicated team shipping continuous innovation — like AI Answers, which understands questions the way customers actually ask them, not just the words in your articles. Request a Demo Built to Empower Sales and Customer-Facing Teams The Help Center is a critical enabler for both existing customers and new prospects: Accelerates onboarding with structured, easy-to-find guidance Supports sales conversations with consistent, trusted information Reinforces credibility and product understanding during the buyer journey Reduces friction post-sale through proactive self-service Frequently Asked Questions Will this actually reduce our support ticket volume? Yes. The Help Center is designed for search-first discovery and AI-assisted answers, helping customers resolve common issues independently before contacting support – directly reducing repetitive tickets and improving first-contact resolution. Can it be fully branded to match our website? Absolutely. The Help Center supports custom domains, branding, and layout customization, so it feels like a natural extension of your website or product. How much effort does it take to set up and maintain? Minimal, your content flows automatically from your KMS environment. Nothing to copy or maintain twice. Can we control who sees what content? Yes. You can serve public, private and hybrid for different audiences from the same Help Center. How do we prove ROI to the business? Through measurable outcomes. Built-in analytics track search success, content engagement, and usage trends to show how self-service improve customer experience. \"A problem shared is a problem halved.\" Help customers help themselves, whenever. Get started today with a free tailored demo from one of our knowledge experts. Get a tailored demo today Our Solutions Call Center Help Center Self Service Field Service Onboarding & Training Integrations Azure OpenAI Integration Salesforce Integration Genesys Integration Zendesk Integration Freshworks Integration Dynamic 365 Integration Microsoft Teams Integration AWS Integration Knowledge Center Blog Videos Events News Guides Webinars Reports Glossary Case Studies ROI Calculator About Book a Demo Lighthouse University Careers Contact us Social LinkedIn YouTube Terms and Privacy Policy Modern Day Slavery Policy KMS Lighthouse Application Privacy Policy Environmental, Social and Governance Policy KMS Lighthouse Application Terms of Use Accessibility Toolbar close Toggle the visibility of the Accessibility Toolbar keyboard Keyboard Navigation visibility_off Disable Animations nights_stay Contrast format_size Increase Text text_fields Decrease Text font_download Readable Font title Mark Titles link Highlight Links & Buttons Powered with favorite Love by Codenroll",
