rational efficiency, quality, and execution. Oversee planning, prioritization, resource allocation, and execution across multiple engineering initiatives. Stay ahead of emerging technologies and industry trends to ensure continuous innovation. Requirements 10+ years of software engineering experience, including significant leadership of large engineering organizations. Proven experience managing global engineering teams through engineering managers. Strong background in enterprise SaaS and modern cloud technologies. Demonstrated success driving AI adoption and modern engineering practices. Exceptional leadership, communication, and stakeholder management skills. Experience building and developing high-performing engineering organizations. Bachelor’s degree in computer science, Engineering, or a related field; advanced degree is an advantage. Apply for this job Our Solutions Call Center Help Center Self Service Field Service Onboarding & Training Integrations Azure OpenAI Integration Salesforce Integration Genesys Integration Zendesk Integration Freshworks Integration Dynamic 365 Integration Microsoft Teams Integration AWS Integration Knowledge Center Blog Videos Events News Guides Webinars Reports Glossary Case Studies ROI Calculator About Book a Demo Lighthouse University Careers Contact us Social LinkedIn YouTube Terms and Privacy Policy Modern Day Slavery Policy KMS Lighthouse Application Privacy Policy Environmental, Social and Governance Policy KMS Lighthouse Application Terms of Use Accessibility Toolbar close Toggle the visibility of the Accessibility Toolbar keyboard Keyboard Navigation visibility_off Disable Animations nights_stay Contrast format_size Increase Text text_fields Decrease Text font_download Readable Font title Mark Titles link Highlight Links & Buttons Powered with favorite Love by Codenroll",
